# Obsidian ops notes

- Tickets live in `ops/tickets/<id>.md`. Filename stem equals YAML `id`.
- Required frontmatter: `id`, `title`, `status`, `priority`, `type`.
- Statuses: `inbox` | `ready` | `plan` | `implement` | `review` | `done` | `blocked`.
- Types: `epic` | `story` | `bug` | `incident` | `workflow`.
- After changing a ticket, run `python3 ops/scripts/board_sync.py`. Do not hand-edit `ops/BOARD.md`.
- New tickets: `python3 ops/scripts/new_ticket.py --prefix PRD --type story --title "…"`.
- Wikilinks are vault-relative (`ops/` is the vault): `[[tickets/WF-001]]`, `[[workflow/LOOP]]`.
- Keep notes short. Put design in `ops/plans/`, logs in `ops/runs/`. Naming: `ops/NAMING.md`.
